<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ndodo kwa Filimoni tsayandikighwa na mtumighwa Pauli (1:1). Pauli tsakakala mwigheletsa hayang'ali yakwandika ibaluwa ino, na ayo yolangusa ibaluwa ino yandikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Roma. Na ka tsakakala Roma, yakoneka kayandika mna ghumwaka ghwa sitini na ghumwe kulawa Kiristu hakalile muisi, chipindi chichila hayandikighwe ibaluwa kwa Wakolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ino tsakamwandikila imunu yakemighwe Filimoni. Filimoni tsakakala imunu wa kanisa, na pfipfila tsakana mtumwa wake yakemighwe Onesimo. Pauli tsakandika ibaluwa ino kumlomba Filimoni yaleke kumuhigha mtumwa wake Onesimo, ghumwande Onesimo tsakatsuma kulawa kuna Filimoni, na kwa malaghitso gha undewa wa Roma, Filimoni ang'adahile kumkoma Onesimo. Pauli komlomba Filimoni kwa kumghuma ghumoyo yambokele Onesimo ka mkiristu miyaghe, na pfipfila Pauli kolomba Filimoni yamlekelele Onesimo yamwapfile yeye Pauli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya (1:1-3) Pauli komlamsa Filimoni.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuya mne isula ya (1:4-21) Pauli komlomba Filimoni ambokele Onesimo ka mkiristu miyaghe.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya (1:22-25) Pauli komalitsila kwa kulonga ule kobama yawangile, na kotuma ndamso tsake.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Pauli, yanyohighwe kwaajili ya Yesu Kiristu. Na ndughu yetu Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p">Twokwandikila ghweghwe sale yetu Filimoni, yatusang'ana ng'onde imwe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>na iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu iwetingana mng'anda mwako, na Afiya lumbu wetu, na Arikipo asikali miyetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nolomba Aba wetu Imulungu na Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu wawatendele uluso na waweng'e tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="s">Unoghelo na inoghola ya Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghose hanilomba, nokukumbuka ghweghwe Filimoni na kumlongela Imulungu mighede, <verse number="5" style="v"/>kwaapfila nihulika pfaumtoghola Imtwatsa Yesu na pfauwanoghela iwanu wose we Imulungu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nokulombela uwe ne ngupfu kuwalongela iwanu wangi inoghola yako, ili wamanye ghendo ghose ghanoghile ghatwinagho twetwe yatwilungile na Kiristu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Unoghelo wako unideng'elesa ng'ani na unighuma ghumoyo. Ghweghwe kuisangalamsa mimoyo ye iwanu wose we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli komlomba Filimoni yambokele Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo, nene ka ndughu yako mne ukwilunga na Kiristu, ning'adahile kukulaghitsa bila kupfuka utende chaubamighwa kutenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni kwaapfila nokunoghela, pfinogha nikulombe. Notenda apfi hata ka nene Pauli nilala, na sambi nene nyohighwa kwaajili ya Kiristu Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo nokulomba umwapfile Onesimo, iyawile imwanangu kubitila ukwilunga na Kiristu hatukalile mchifungo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ghumwande tsakakala kahela sang'ano kuna ghweghwe, lekeni sambi kana sang'ano kuna nene na kuna ghweghwe pfipfila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lelo nomuyitsa keli kuna ghweghwe, yeye ka ghumoyo ghwangu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tsambama akale na nene, yakutendele ng'onde ino ya kunyapfila hano mchifungo, kwaajili ya kupeta Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni sibama bae kukunanahitsa unyapfile, ila nobama utende pfaubama. Apfo sitenda ichinu chochose mbaka utoghole.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lamda Onesimo tsakakala kutali naghwe chidogho, ili yoye keli kuna ghweghwe ukale naye ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lelo yeye si mtumwa keli ila kanogha kubita mtumwa, yeye sambi kandughu yetu mne ukwilunga na Kiristu. Kanoghela nene na katsokunoghela ghweghwe ghendo, mana yeye kamunu miyetu na ndughu yetu mne kwilunga ne Imtwatsa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo ka kwombona nene nandughu yako, umbokele Onesimo ka pfunibokela nene. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ka katenda ichinu chochose chihile au kakubunza chinu, nene nitsokuliha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nene Pauli nakwandika imwenyegho kwa ghumoko ghwangu, nitsokuliha. Sibama bae kukukumbusa unilihe ughima wako. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ndughu yangu utende pfino kwa kunyapfila nene kwaajili ye Imtwatsa, lelo ghweghwe ka ndughu yangu mne ukwilunga na Kiristu udeng'elese ghumoyo ghwangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nokutoghola, nokwandikila ghano, nomanya kutsotenda kubita ghano ghanikulongele. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hamwe na hagho, mnyandalile hanu ho kuwasa, kwaapfila nololela Imulungu katsakwidika ghamumlomba na nene nitsomwangilani.</para>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa utsighilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Epafura, iyohighwe hamwe na nene kwaajili ya kumsang'anila Kiristu Yesu, kokulamsa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nawo tsina Maliki, Aristariko, Dema na Luka, iwosang'ana na nene pfipfila wokulamsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Uluso we Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu ukale namwe mwose.</para>
</usx>
